// Title: Non-privileged Usage of Reg or Powershell
// ID: 8f02c935-effe-45b3-8fc9-ef8696a9e41d
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Ryan Plas (rule), oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-05
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
// Description: Search for usage of reg or Powershell by non-privileged users to modify service configuration in registry
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((((process.command_line like "*_reg *" and process.command_line like "*_add*")) or ((process.command_line like "*_powershell*" or process.command_line like "*_set-itemproperty*" or process.command_line like "*_ sp *" or process.command_line like "*_new-itemproperty*"))) and ((IntegrityLevel == "Medium" or IntegrityLevel == "S-1-16-8192") and (process.command_line like "*_ControlSet*" and process.command_line like "*_Services*") and (process.command_line like "*_ImagePath*" or process.command_line like "*_FailureCommand*" or process.command_line like "*_ServiceDLL*")))
